                <p>Continue into role-based Moodle dashboards for courses, progress, assessment, attendance, announcements and learning services.</p>
                <div class="boc-login-slide-metrics">
                    <span><strong data-boc-count="{{boclogin.stats.users.raw}}">{{boclogin.stats.users.value}}</strong><small>active users</small></span>
                    <span><strong data-boc-count="{{boclogin.stats.enrolments.raw}}">{{boclogin.stats.enrolments.value}}</strong><small>course enrolments</small></span>
